Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:09.33,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I collect junk and she builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.75,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,The sky gets cloudier and cloudier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:25.68,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I hope we'll be able to fly with\Nthose wings before winter comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:37.65,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,When winter comes, she won't be able to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.65,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,She said so herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:45.53,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:50.53,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,but I think it's something she can't do anything about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:14.68,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
