Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:02:01.81,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:02:01.81,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:04.10,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
