Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.23,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.23,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:08.44,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:08.44,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.19,0:02:10.94,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.19,0:02:10.94,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:14.90,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:14.90,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
