Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:28.09,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Bye bye. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:30.59,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:33.72,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'd like to see everyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:36.60,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll hang out with you even if I become famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:39.10,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,See you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:39.10,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:44.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:11.09,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:11.09,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}A Season of Beginnings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:15.89,Default,San,0,0,0,,Once again, congratulation for graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.18,Default,San,0,0,0,,You are a part of society now, Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:20.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,More like I'm a professional bum starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:23.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,What are your plans from here? {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular. {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.86,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:30.90,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Do you want to work for us for a while? {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:37.95,Default,San,0,0,0,,That'd be great. If you would, I'd be able to make a bento for Nagisa from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:42.54,Default,San,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to, but I just couldn't find the time to in the mornings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:44.75,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Your pay will be really small.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You'd better be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:48.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:51.76,Default,San,0,0,0,,I look forward to working with you, Tomoya-san. {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:53.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Tomoya-san"? {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.14,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please let me call you by name. {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:59.56,Default,San,0,0,0,,Since we're like family now. {ep 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:08.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you would work here, I'm sure it will be a big help to both Dad and Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:11.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I can't be under their care forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:15.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The weather's getting warmer, and I'm starting to get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think I'll be able to go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:20.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if you can be in the same class as Tomoyo and Miyazawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:21.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:28.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Work began at 5 am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:34.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The old man would already be working on baking bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:43.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san showed me the ropes as she set the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:51.57,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Today's the opening ceremony, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:56.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.45,0:04:58.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good luck, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:09.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The peak hours continue until 9 am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The day's sales are concentrated during this period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Once afternoon hits, few customers come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:24.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san teaches class to the kids in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:28.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's important income for the Furukawas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:30.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:31.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.78,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:38.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The old man occasionally wandered off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:40.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No one knew to where and what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:43.08,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's boring, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:44.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:48.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder if Nagisa's doing all right at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:51.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do even if we worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:54.42,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How about we play a little catch using Sanae's bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You shouldn't play with food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.76,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't be so strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.55,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You should have fun when you work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:03.47,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Welc-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:06.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:09.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I wanted to see Tomoya-kun working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What class did you end up in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm with people I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:19.57,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But it looks like there are a lot of nice people,\Nso I'm looking forward to getting to know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:20.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:26.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right. Now that we have more people,\Nlet's have a snowball fight using Sanae's bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:27.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom's right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,My bread was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.80,Default,San,0,0,0,,My bread was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:38.38,Default,San,0,0,0,,...meant to hit others with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I luf fem!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.26,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Fanae!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:46.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was slowly beginning to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:51.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The old man and Sanae-san always made sure Nagisa was laughing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:53.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm off, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Today's the clubs' open house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I made a script and memorized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:05.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. Did you eat your breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:12.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I polished it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:29.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:34.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:37.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How did the open house go? Did it go well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:41.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I got a good reaction to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:46.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa. Tell {\i1}me{\i0\fscx30} {\r} the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:51.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't speak well during the open house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:57.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But Tomoyo-san, Miyazawa-san, and Nishina-san clapped for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:59.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Have you found an advisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:04.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Minoshima Sensei from the track team\Nwill be advising us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:05.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:13.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,{\fscx105}But if I can't get two more people to sign up by Wednesday next week, the Theater Club will be automatically closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:15.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I've got to work hard so that doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.65,0:08:19.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's it like in your class?\NDo you think you can make friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do people know that you're repeating twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:25.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Everyone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:29.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's why it looks like it's hard for everyone to talk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:36.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're good with people, so I don't think anyone would be annoyed even if you approached them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.42,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:42.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to continue the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:45.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:49.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to talk about fun things with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:54.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to talk about what happened at school with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:56.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:01.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's talk a lot about fun stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:02.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:19.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I never heard any fun stories about what happened at school from Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs54\c&H1B253A&\frz350.711\pos(993,579)\blur0.5}Recruiting Members
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs36\frz357.904\pos(717,240)\c&H335568&\blur0.5}Theater Club
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs30\frz351.803\pos(955.5,658.5)\c&H1F2436&\blur0.5}Club room: Old Building 3F East End of the Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs30\frz351.803\pos(994.5,741)\c&H1C202A&\blur0.5}President: Senior Furukawa
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:23.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Saying "Good luck" to her may have just put pressure on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It crossed my mind that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...I might have been pushing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:33.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But Nagisa was never tardy\Nto school nor did she ever skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:35.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She continued to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:47.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In the end, not a single person joined the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:10.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.60,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Hey. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like you're really busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.85,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're short on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Since it's a tough job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.86,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. Congratulation on graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.61,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:30.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Something like helping with chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:32.24,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Come visit us once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:37.25,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Though, I'm working and Kouko's at the hospital during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:41.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kouko-san's sister's been in hospital for a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:45.21,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah. But she believes she'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.01,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,So I won't lose hope either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.22,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:50.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah. Sorry to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:51.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.77,Note,,0,0,0,,Sign: Apartments
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's pretty expensive even if it's far from the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:07.69,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:19.29,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I want to wear my hair long, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:22.21,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:25.92,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Okazaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:27.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Long time no see. Are you on your way home from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:31.42,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:35.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's been since our graduation. Is Nagisa better?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:37.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. She goes to school every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.68,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:44.77,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We're in the same city, so we want to come visit once in a while, but we can't seem to find the time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:48.94,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,We're always saying that we'd like to meet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,School's that busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,How about you? Still a freeloading bum?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:57.33,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Onee-chan. "Bum" is a little-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:11:58.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:01.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.71,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't act so mature. You're throwing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:09.59,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Get your act straight. Do something and a result will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:14.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was just seeing if there were any cheap rooms, but I can't find one that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:20.27,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,My friend's older brother will be moving out of his room soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.27,0:12:25.23,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's an old place, but he said the rent is very cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:29.23,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That was uncalled for, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:33.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No! Tell me more about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:42.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:48.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:50.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:53.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...work with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:55.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:03.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I see. So you're going to leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.56,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm happy with the choice you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:08.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you. After all, I have been pampered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:10.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Do you have money?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. The pay you've given me has hardly been touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right, then I won't say any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:17.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking care of me for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't you have to look after the shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:40.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,No one's gonna come at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:46.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You looked like you wanted to play with me,\Nso with no choice, I'm out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:47.56,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You'd better thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:51.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm the one playing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:54.44,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:55.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:57.99,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Come to me when you have any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.61,0:14:02.24,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Lots of things happen once you step into society.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:04.62,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Ask for help whenever you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:08.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you. Those words are enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You talk like a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:18.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,One day...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:21.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can I take Nagisa with me one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.99,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She's the one who has to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.91,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She's not a little kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Give me your best pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:02.72,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm called the Babe Ruth of bread around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:07.22,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nice pitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.73,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Go apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:19.24,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm going back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's really tiny isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:35.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And it's a really old place, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:37.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It looks like mice live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:39.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, it's a very nice room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The breeze flows nicely when the window's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It looks like someone's living here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll return the car and go straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:09.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry to even take furniture and dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:12.04,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's fine. We weren't using them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:15.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't come home too late all right, Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:16.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:18.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:19.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:32.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll make some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:35.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You sit and wait, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.15,0:16:41.28,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,{\an8}Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.53,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,{\an8}Big dango family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:47.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder if the day we live together like this will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:46.70,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,{\an8}Dango-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:49.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What was that, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:56.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:56.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:16:58.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:03.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Have you told your father that you've moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.43,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You should let him know where you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:08.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,in the case anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:11.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're right. I'll let him know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:16.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, and good night, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:17.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:32.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My independent life began like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:36.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to rely on anyone any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:43.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sleep didn't come easily to me that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:47.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:49.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:51.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Your work starts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:56.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll come cook dinner, too, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know when I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:14.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:20.63,Default,Oak,0,0,0,,"It's fine."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:22.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:34.39,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs45\b1\c&H566E83&\pos(849,163.5)\blur0.5}Electrical design and setting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:34.39,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs54\b1\c&H566E83&\blur0.5\pos(849,256.5)}Hikarizaka Electric
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:40.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:44.32,Default,All,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Um, ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:47.28,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,So you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:49.53,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Change into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:52.12,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:54.99,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Yoshino-kun, is he the one you said will be coming starting today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:55.91,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:58.08,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,This is the manager. Introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm Okazaki Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:06.67,Default,Man,0,0,0,,The first few days might be tough,\Nbut you'll get used to it if you keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:08.80,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Just be mindful of injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:14.14,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:18.31,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You look like a different person from the one I first met last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:21.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Back then, you literally were a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.35,0:19:23.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do I look like an adult now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:26.98,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,No. You look like a kid who's struggling to become an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:29.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So I'm a kid after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:31.90,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,They're two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:33.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.12,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,There's a difference in how serious you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:40.37,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't quit on us in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.12,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You'll depress me if you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:45.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please don't worry. My life is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:57.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Put the ladder up against the electrical pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:19:58.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.31,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,And wear the helmet properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:01.85,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:06.31,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Don't try to support your body with your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:10.28,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sit back on the rope. It's safer that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,E-Even if say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.32,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Lean into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:16.62,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You won't last the day if you waste energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:18.83,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You tighten the bolts in diagonal order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:19.79,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It's a rule of thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.79,0:20:22.54,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You check everything at the end. Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:23.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.37,0:20:26.29,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,All right. Try tightening this bolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:26.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:32.76,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:33.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:35.89,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Failure isn't allowed in this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:39.10,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What would have happened if a person had been walking down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:42.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What if someone important was down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:45.23,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,That's why you do everything carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:47.90,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Neatly and compassionately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:48.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:52.99,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Is it rough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:55.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My entire body's aching.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.11,0:20:57.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I had confidence in stamina, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:20:58.99,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everything comes with experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:00.74,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,We're going to the next place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:05.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How many more do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:08.29,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Four more like the one we just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:11.25,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Good bye, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:13.76,Default,All,0,0,0,,Bye. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:17.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:24.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:28.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:29.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:32.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.61,0:21:33.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:38.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Something really good happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:42.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Music class was with the class Nishina-san is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:43.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:47.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Nishina-san was worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:50.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:55.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You look really tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:57.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Should you go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.47,0:22:01.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No. Rather than that, let me hear more of your day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:03.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.36,0:23:42.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.37,0:23:47.33,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You're not holding the spanner right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:49.04,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I showed you how it's done many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:50.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:52.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.62,0:23:55.50,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Have you checked the junctions?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:57.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:59.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:03.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sorry. There's a mock exam on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:08.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry, when we're already losing our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 11
